From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <chrisbreuer93@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:31:57 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] sql: a blocking wait honours timeouts, signals, COPY streams
 and the resolver it can see

The changes of d7f40e00c on the stacks branch, on bun-v1.4.4: this tag
reads the arguments of the connection constructors from the call frame.
